  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1223887/description_41af7c62-f280-4d96-a2f9-35b27f20ce11.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Better Lucky Block</strong></span> 将经典的幸运方块体验（<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>枯燥乏味</em></span>）转变为一款全新的模组，其中充满了有趣、刺激且原创的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">物品</span>！该模组增强了著名的幸运方块，提供了更广泛的令人兴奋的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">事件</span>、更强的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">物品</span>，甚至是<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">更疯狂的陷阱</span>。</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em>特<span style=\"color:#3598db\">色</span></em>:</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>🔨 <strong>超过 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">40</span> 种新的随机事件</strong>：每次打开方块时，都会出现新的<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">生物</span>、<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">物品</span>和<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">结构</span>。<br>💥 <strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">增强</span>惊喜</strong>：大量<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">新事件</span>发生，只展示全新的内容！<br>💎 <strong>更多的<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">传奇</span>物品</strong>：新的装备和武器来改善你的体验。<br>⚡ <strong><span style=\"color:#169179\">运气</span>或<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">厄运</span></strong>：一如既往，命运可能残酷也可能慷慨，你打开的每一个方块都可能改变冒险的进程。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3a9b057d-56bd-47db-86a7-4792e35530eb.png\"></p>",
